== CANON-13 (range-types): a set of one Range tests values of that Range.
Type
    TPercent Range 0..100
    TDigit Range 0..9

Main :
    Seen Set<TPercent> := [0, 50]
    D TDigit := 0
    PutLn(50 in Seen)
    PutLn(D in Seen)
;
